# steep_climb_stars.jsc - full climb at night; the camera looks up into the star field.
# Checks (group B): sky bands, star twinkle between climb_a and climb_b, Milky Way, mostly sky;
# no EMPTY pixels.
0     persist assist 2
0     tod night
0     state title
+0    state free
+0.5  seek sea 40
+0.5  hold W 2.5
+1.0  shot climb_a
+0.5  shot climb_b
+0    assert pitch > 0.6
+0    assert empty_px == 0
+0.6  shot climb_top
+0    assert empty_px == 0
+0    sheet steep_climb_stars 3
+0    end
